<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    #parse("views/common/head.vm")
    <style>
        body{
            font-size:14px;
            background-color: #EEEEEE;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .guide_view{
            width: 100%;
        }
        .guide_view_title{
            background-color: white;
            display: flex;
        }
        .title_main_body{
            flex: 1;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .title_left_info{
            padding: 20px 20px 40px 100px;
        }
        .title_left_info_body{
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .title_info{
            font-family: PingFangSC-Medium;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #070707;
            letter-spacing: 0;
            line-height: 28px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .title_body{
            font-family: PingFangSC-Regular;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666666;
            letter-spacing: 0;
            font-weight: 400;
            width: 80%;
        }
        .title_btn{
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .title_right_info{
            background-image: url(${basePath}/static/images/wt2x.png);
            background-size: 90% 100%;
        }
        a,
        a:link,
        a:visited,
        a:hover,
        a:active,
        a:focus{
           color:inherit;
           text-decoration:none;
           outline: 0;
        }
        a{
            webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }
        .opr_btn{
            border: 1px solid rgba(199,13,13,1);
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-family: PingFangSC-Regular;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #C70D0D !important;
            letter-spacing: 0;
            font-weight: 400;
            padding: 5px 25px;
        }
        .guide_view_body{
            background-color: white;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 30px 30px 0px 30px;
        }
        .guide_view_body_title{
            font-family: PingFangSC-Medium;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #070707;
            letter-spacing: 0;
            line-height: 24px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .guide_view_body_info{
            margin-top: 20px;
            display: flex;
        }
        .guide_view_body_info_b{
        }
        .body_info_left_dt{
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .guide_info_btn_l{
            opacity: 0.2;
            background: #888A8C;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 100%;
        }
        .guide_info_btn_r{
            margin-left: 5px;
            font-family: PingFangSC-Medium;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #303343;
            letter-spacing: 0;
            line-height: 24px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .body_info_left_body{
            display:none;
        }
        .body_info_left_body{
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .show .body_info_left_title .guide_info_btn_l{
            background: #FF7F03;
            opacity: 1;
        }
        .show .body_info_left_body{
            display:block;
            width: 80%;
            padding-left: 35px;
        }
        .guide_view_body_info_left{
            width: 30%;
        }
        .guide_view_body_info_right{
            width: 100%;
        }
        .guide_view_body_info_right img{
            width: 100%;
            height: 90%;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="guide_view">
        <div class="guide_view_title">
            <div class="title_main_body title_left_info">
                <div class="title_left_info_body title_info">
                    应收款管理
                </div>
                <div class="title_left_info_body title_body">
                    应收账款管理功能是通过将企业的应收款（可通过对接ERP后推送或直接手工录入）与企业的收款（银行流水等）进行核销处理，跟踪企业应收款回款情况，对应收未收的进行到期提醒和逾期预警、催收管理，同时提供应收款回款分析、账龄分析等报表查询。
                </div>
                <div class="title_left_info_body title_btn">
                    <a class="opr_btn" href="javascript:;" onclick="add()">立即创建</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="title_main_body title_right_info">
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="guide_view_body">
            <div class="guide_view_body_title">
                丰富的帮助指引，伴随您搭建应收款业务
            </div>
            <div class="guide_view_body_info">
                <div class="guide_view_body_info_b guide_view_body_info_left">
                    <div id="body_info_left_dt_1" class="show body_info_left_dt">
                        <div class="body_info_left_title">
                            <a href="javascript:;" onclick="changeBody(1)">
                                <span class="guide_info_btn_l">1</span>
                                <span class="guide_info_btn_r">设置业务参数</span>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="body_info_left_body">
                            设置业务参数：系统已预置相关参数，同时支持自定义进行基础设置以及逾期账款预警设置。设置后将在应收款到期前进行消息提醒，应收款到期后进行风险预警。
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="body_info_left_dt_2" class="body_info_left_dt">
                        <div class="body_info_left_title">
                            <a href="javascript:;" onclick="changeBody(2)">
                                <span class="guide_info_btn_l">2</span>
                                <span class="guide_info_btn_r">添加或导入应收单据</span>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="body_info_left_body">
                            1.通过“新增”按钮，单笔录入应收单据。
                            2.通过“导入”功能一次性导入多条记录。
                            3.通过与您现有的财务软件进行集成，自动推送应收单数据。
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="body_info_left_dt_3" class="body_info_left_dt">
                        <div class="body_info_left_title">
                            <a href="javascript:;" onclick="changeBody(3)">
                                <span class="guide_info_btn_l">3</span>
                                <span class="guide_info_btn_r">执行核销处理</span>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="body_info_left_body">
                            当收到客户的付款时，使用“核销处理”功能与相应的应收单据进行匹配。支持银行流水、票据、信用证等多种结算方式的核销。
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="body_info_left_dt_4" class="body_info_left_dt">
                        <div class="body_info_left_title">
                            <a href="javascript:;" onclick="changeBody(4)">
                                <span class="guide_info_btn_l">4</span>
                                <span class="guide_info_btn_r">应收款管理相关数据的查询</span>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="body_info_left_body">
                            查询应收款核销情况、账龄分析、应收款提醒和预警、催收登记查询。
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="guide_view_body_info_b guide_view_body_info_right">
                    <img id="showBodyImg" src="${basePath}/static/images/peitu_1_img@2x.png">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
#parse("views/common/footer.vm")
<script>
    var add;
    bt.use(['form','jquery','element'], function(){
        var form = bt.form(),$  = bt.jquery;
		bt.element();

        add = function() {
            if (bt.navtab) {
                bt.navtab.addNavtab(bt.lang('common.add.data'), basePath + "/accountReceivable/docManage/add");
                return;
            }
            parent.layer.open({
                type: 2,
                area: ['850px', '530px'],
                maxmin: true,
                content: basePath + "/accountReceivable/docManage/add",
                end: function () {
                    datatable && datatable.draw();
                }
            });
        }

    });

    function changeBody(type){
        $('.body_info_left_dt').removeClass('show');
        $('#body_info_left_dt_'+type).addClass('show');
        $('#showBodyImg').attr('src', '${basePath}/static/images/peitu_'+type+'_img@2x.png');
    }
</script>
</body>
</html>
